        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In September 2022, we entered into agreements with MRO Holdings, an aviation services provider specializing in maintenance, repair and overhaul services, for the lease of facilities and sale of TechOps MX operating assets, to MRO Mexico, a subsidiary of MRO Holdings.",
