        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our airline brands, we offer aviation-related services to Aeroméxico and to Aeroméxico Connect, as well as to unrelated third parties, through our subsidiaries such as training services through our subsidiary AM Formación;",
