        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-197494",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "These agreements generally follow the IATA format, and we rely on our SkyTeam partners or other third-party providers with respect to the provision of airport services in airports outside of Mexico.",
